  "details": "Overview\n\nEven if you click “Go My Profile” in the profile settings while your age has been verified, you are redirected to an empty profile.\n\nSteps\n\n1. While your age is verified,\n\nvisit https://vrchat.com/home/profile\n\n2. Click “Go My Profile”\n\n3. You are redirected to an empty profile\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/user/me\n\nYou should be redirected here.\n\nNormally, you should be taken to your own profile page (e.g., https://vrchat.com/home/user/usr_710dcb6b-d336-4317-8d8b-cfea038739a5).\n\nThe likely cause is that the redirect function for the URL “https://vrchat.com/home/user/me” is not working properly.",
